rmland-atlas/oklahoma/custer-county"],["ARC or PLC in Custer County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/custer-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Custer County came in under 90% of normal for January to February in 39 of the 75 years on record since 1951. In 2025 that middle ran 179% of normal for March to April and just 19% for November to December. So far in 2026 it sits at 28% of normal for February to March. Grid 18423 had its driest year in 1956 at 48% of normal.</p>"}
